SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The sseemm__ttiimmeeddwwaaiitt() function conforms to IEEE Std 1003.1-2004
     (“POSIX.1”).  The sseemm__cclloocckkwwaaiitt__nnpp() function is not specified by any
     standard; it exists only on FreeBSD at the time of this writing.

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The sseemm__ttiimmeeddwwaaiitt() function first appeared in FreeBSD 5.0.  The
     sseemm__cclloocckkwwaaiitt__nnpp() function first appeared in FreeBSD 11.1.

